        "## 🔄 Part 3: Array Traversal Using Loops\n",
        "\n",
        "While direct indexing is great for single items, **traversal** means visiting every element in an array one by one.\n",
        "\n",
        "We use `for` loops to make traversal fast, clean, and efficient!\n",
        "\n",
        "### Two Ways to Loop Through a List:\n",
        "1. **Looping by Item:** `for item in list_name:`\n",
        "2. **Looping by Index:** `for i in range(len(list_name)):`\n",
        "\n",
        "Let's test both methods below!"
      ]
    },
