        "---\n",
        "## 🧰 Part 5: Essential Python Built-in List Methods\n",
        "\n",
        "Python provides powerful built-in methods and functions to modify and inspect lists without writing long loops!\n",
        "\n",
        "| Method / Function | What It Does | Example |\n",
        "| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n",
        "| **`len(list)`** | Returns total number of items | `len(backpack)` |\n",
        "| **`sum(list)`** | Calculates sum of numeric items | `sum(quiz_scores)` |\n",
        "| **`max(list)` / `min(list)`** | Finds highest / lowest value | `max(quiz_scores)` |\n",
        "| **`append(item)`** | Adds item to the **end** of list | `backpack.append(\"Binder\")` |\n",
        "| **`insert(index, item)`** | Inserts item at specific position | `backpack.insert(1, \"Ruler\")` |\n",
        "| **`remove(item)`** | Removes first occurrence of item | `backpack.remove(\"Pen\")` |\n",
        "| **`pop(index)`** | Removes & returns item at index | `backpack.pop(0)` |\n",
        "| **`sort()` / `sorted()`** | Sorts list in ascending order | `quiz_scores.sort()` |\n",
